  _cardName: Simbiose Industrial (Economia Circular)
  _description: "Res\xEDduo de uma ind\xFAstria vira insumo da ind\xFAstria vizinha,
    num ciclo fechado. Modelo real: o distrito industrial de Kalundborg, na Dinamarca,
    a simbiose industrial mais estudada do mundo \u2014 d\xE9cadas rodando sem perder
    res\xEDduo."
  _cardNameEn: Industrial Symbiosis (Circular Economy)
  _descriptionEn: "One industry's waste becomes the neighboring industry's input,
    in a closed loop. Real model: the Kalundborg industrial district in Denmark,
    the most studied industrial symbiosis in the world \u2014 decades running without
    losing waste."
